# Comparison engine

Home is navigation plus an Agent Intelligence Bar. Do not add more large Home blocks.

Dedicated tabs:

- Eligibility Center — official Florida Medicaid/MyACCESS, Extra Help, Medicare eligibility
- Call Checklist — ZIP, doctors, hospitals, medications, pharmacy, Medicaid/LIS, priorities
- What Changed 2027 — side-by-side 2026→2027 changes, pending until official SOB
- Update Log — dated corrections, new SOB links, discrepancy queue

Never declare a “best plan.” Surface options for agent review.
Keep commissionability, AOR, certification, and Focus Plan notes off client-facing views.
Every enrollment reminder must say: verify current SOB, provider directory, and formulary.
